<div class="main_wrapper no_banner"  >
    <div class="page-title-wrap">
    <div class="page_title page_title-small " style="">
      <h1>Tucker Together</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  
         
       
    
        <div class="main_breadcrumb">
            <div class="container">
                <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
					         <ol class="breadcrumb-pages breadcrumb"><li class="breadcrumb-item" aria-current="page"><a href="https://www.tuckerga.gov" class="homeBreadCrumb"><i class="fa fa-home"></i>  Home</a></li> <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Tucker Together</li></ol>                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
                        
         
		            <div class="main_content">
			         
<div class="wp-block-group gray has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<p class="has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:uppercase"><strong>Learn How Annexation Would IMPACT Our Community</strong></p>



<div class="row row-eq-height">	
<div class="col-sm-5" style="background-color: #ebdfc8;">
<br>
<p style="background-color: #ffffff;"><br>
<img decoding="async" src="https://www.tuckerga.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/tucker-together-logo-x1200.png" alt="ANNEXATION"></p>
<p><b><u>INTRODUCTION TO ANNEXATION</u></b></p>

	<p><b>WHAT IS ANNEXATION?</b><br>Annexation is the legal process of adding a new area to a city&#8217;s boundaries and jurisdiction, making the area part of the city. Following annexation, specified municipal services would be provided by the City of Tucker.</p>
	<p><b>WHAT YOU&#8217;LL SEE ON YOUR BALLOT</b><br>
	Official Ballot Question: “Shall the Act which annexes certain land into the City of Tucker be approved?”</p>

	<p><b>WHAT THIS VOTE MEANS FOR YOU</b>
</p><ul>
<li>
<b>A &#8220;YES&#8221; Vote</b> would approve the annexation and place the proposed area within the City of Tucker.</li>
<li><b>A &#8220;NO&#8221; Vote</b> would not approve the annexation, and the proposed area would remain part of unincorporated DeKalb County.</li>
</ul>

<p><b>MUNICIPAL SERVICES AND GOVERNANCE FOLLOWING ANNEXATION</b><br>
</p><ul>
<li>Paving streets and building or repairing sidewalks would be provided by the City of Tucker.</li>
<li>Annexation would integrate your neighborhood into Tucker&#8217;s transportation plan to secure funding for connected trail networks and safer commutes.</li> 
<li>Becoming part of Tucker would transfer responsibility for local park planning and facility investments to the city.</li>
<li>Residents would be eligible to vote in City of Tucker elections and communicate with city officials regarding municipal matters as citizens of Tucker.</li>
<li>City personnel would conduct safety inspections and enforce applicable property-maintenance codes on apartments.</li>
</ul>

	
</div>	
<div class="col-sm-7 text-white equal" style="text-align: center; background-color: #011d30;">
		<div class="col-sm-1">&nbsp;</div>
		<div class="col-sm-11" style="text-align: left;">
<br>

			<p><b><u>ACCOLADES FOR THE CITY OF TUCKER</u></b>
</p><ul style="color:white;">
<li style="color:white;">Winner of the Urbanize Atlanta 2025 (Sub)urban Smackdown tournament<sup>[1]</sup>
</li><li style="color:white;">Named the #1 suburb in the AJC’s Best of Atlanta reader poll<sup>[2]</sup>
</li><li style="color:white;">Winner of Georgia Recreation and Parks Association awards for top special events, maintenance and programming<sup>[3]</sup>
</li><li style="color:white;">Earned the Atlanta Regional Commission’s New Leaf designation for sustainability<sup>[4]</sup></li><li style="color:white;">Ranked by Niche among the 15 most diverse cities in Georgia<sup>[5]</sup></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p><b><u>KEEPING OUR NEIGHBORHOODS CLEAN &amp; WELL-MAINTAINED</u></b></p>
<ul>
<li style="color:white;">More than 293 acres of green space, 20 miles of trails maintained weekly and multiple community recreation facilities.<sup>[6]</sup></li>
<li style="color:white;">Tucker actively worked on redrawing boundaries so that the entire city would be united under one dedicated police precinct.<sup>[7]</sup></li>
<li style="color:white;">Businesses and shopping centers like Northlake Mall and Briarcliff Village petitioned to be annexed into Tucker.<sup>[8,9]</sup></li><li style="color:white;">Over the last decade, 113.5 miles of roadways have been repaved in the City of Tucker.</li><li style="color:white;">Tackling everything from potholes to traffic signals, Tucker Public Works completed over 1,400 improvement projects last year alone.</li><li style="color:white;">Tucker Code Enforcement prioritized rapid response times this year, addressing 73% of reported cases on the same day.</li><li style="color:white;">Open 62 hours a week, the Tucker Recreation Center welcomed over 36,000 visitors last year.</li><li style="color:white;">Community sports programming drew more than 1,900 active participants last year in Tucker.</li><li style="color:white;">More than 1,750 kids took part in City of Tucker Youth Camps over the past year.</li></ul>
<p><img decoding="async" src="https://www.tuckerga.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/tkr-logo-white-small.png" alt="tucker logo" style="align: center;"></p>
<p></p>
		</div>
	
</div>
	
	</div>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="background-color:#fefeff">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading cheading has-large-font-size">WHICH AREA WOULD BE ANNEXED?</h2>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-columns advgb-columns-wrapper" id="advgb-cols-f0b99c50-3af0-42d2-ba93-11f2dac19355"><div class="advgb-columns-container"><div class="advgb-columns advgb-columns-row advgb-is-mobile advgb-columns-2 layout-13-23 mbl-layout-stacked gutter-20 vgutter-10">
<div class="wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-one-third-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile" id="advgb-col-7124bd3d-40e8-4313-a850-05f2f9ef3004"><div class="advgb-column-inner" style="border-style:none;border-width:1px">
<div class="wp-block-advgb-image advgb-image-block full-width advgb-lightbox advgb-img-9d109a37-f454-43bf-827e-66879759a765" style="background-image:url(https://www.tuckerga.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/sb622-map-updated.jpg);background-position:53% 54%;height:428px;width:500px;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:flex-start" data-image="https://www.tuckerga.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/sb622-map-updated.jpg"><a class="advgb-image-overlay" style="background-color:var(--main-theme-primary-color)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a><h5 class="advgb-image-title" style="color:#fff">Senate Bill 622<br>Annexation Map</h5><p class="advgb-image-subtitle" style="color:#fff">One Community.<br>One Future.<br></p></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-two-thirds-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile" id="advgb-col-06fd14a6-eb7e-4870-a4ab-05f4691dc98c"><div class="advgb-column-inner" style="border-style:none;border-width:1px">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The proposed annexation under Senate Bill 622 (SB 622), which voters will decide on November 3rd, covers the area shown on the detailed map. <a href="https://www.tuckerga.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/sb622-map-updated.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow"><strong>View the annexation area map</strong>.</a></p>



<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Annexation Process in Georgia:</strong></h4>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Local Act of the General Assembly and Referendum</strong><br>This method requires a question to appear on the ballots of residents of the proposed annexation area, asking them to vote “yes” or “no” on annexation. The outcome of this vote will decide whether the defined area becomes part of the city. This November, voters who reside in the annexation area will have the opportunity to choose for themselves whether they want to join the city.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ballot Information: </strong>On the November 3rd election ballot, residents in the proposed annexation area will vote on whether to approve or deny the effort.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Preview your ballot</strong> on the Georgia Secretary of State&#8217;s website. <a href="https://mvp.sos.ga.gov/s/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Preview your sample ballot.</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Additional Resource:</strong> The Georgia Municipal Association&#8217;s <a href="https://www.gacities.com/resources/gma-publications/growing-cities-growing-georgia-a-guide-to-georgias-annexation-law" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">guide to Georgia&#8217;s annexation law</a> explains the process in detail.</p>
</div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-adv-tabs advgb-tabs-wrapper advgb-tab-horz-desktop advgb-tab-vert-tablet advgb-tab-stack-mobile advgb-tabs-ca64833c-66fe-48f3-a8f8-6cb32559bbfd" data-tab-active="0"><ul class="advgb-tabs-panel"><li class="advgb-tab" style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px"><a id="" href="#advgb-tabs-tab0" style="color:#fff"><span>Legislation and Voting Information</span></a></li><li class="advgb-tab" style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px"><a id="" href="#advgb-tabs-tab1" style="color:#fff"><span>What Do You Need to Do Now?</span></a></li><li class="advgb-tab" style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px"><a id="" href="#advgb-tabs-tab2" style="color:#fff"><span>FAQ</span></a></li><li class="advgb-tab" style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px"><a id="" href="#advgb-tabs-tab3" style="color:#fff"><span>Sample Ballot</span></a></li></ul><div class="advgb-tab-body-wrapper" style="border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px">
<div class="wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container"><div class="advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-">Legislation and Voting Information</div><div class="advgb-tab-_bf944f-85 advgb-tab-body" aria-labelledby="advgb-tabs-tab0">
<p class="has-background-background-color has-background has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Legislative Overview</strong><br><br>Supported by local DeKalb lawmakers, including Senators Kim Jackson, Tonya Anderson, Sally Harrell and Elena Parent, as well as Representatives Karla Drenner, Imani Barnes, Billy Mitchell, Scott Holcomb and Viola Davis, SB 622 passed during the 2026 Georgia General Assembly session. This effort by the local delegation ensures the annexation plan is brought directly before the residents of unincorporated DeKalb County in the proposed area for a vote.</p>



<div class="wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-37befbfe wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Election Dates:</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Voter Registration Deadline to Vote on Annexation was October 5, 2026</li>



<li><span style="background-color: initial;">Early Voting: October 13 – October 30</span></li>



<li><span style="background-color: initial;">Election Day: November 3, 2026</span></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Call to Action:</strong> Ensure your voter registration is up-to-date and make a plan to vote! <a href="https://mvp.sos.ga.gov/s/">Check your voter registration here</a>.</p>
</div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container"><div class="advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-">What Do You Need to Do Now?</div><div class="advgb-tab-_4d87da-39 advgb-tab-body" aria-labelledby="advgb-tabs-tab1">
<p class="has-background-background-color has-background has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:uppercase">ELECTION DAY IS NOVEMBER 3</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Steps for Residents:</strong></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Check to See if Your Home is in the Annexation Area:</strong> Find a detailed map of properties included in the annexation area. <a href="https://www.tuckerga.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/sb622-map-updated.jpg">View the annexation area map.</a></li>



<li><strong>Ensure Your Voter Registration is Up-to-Date. </strong>Make sure your address is current. <a href="https://mvp.sos.ga.gov/s/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Check your voter registration status.</a></li>



<li><strong>Mark Election Dates: </strong>Add early voting dates and Election Day to your calendar. <a href="https://dekalbcountyga.gov/departments/voter-registration-and-elections#docaccess-8057245d49f3fa6f0169062419c07503" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Find information about early voting here.</a></li>



<li><strong>Review Your Ballot: </strong>Familiarize yourself with the annexation question before voting. <a href="https://mvp.sos.ga.gov/s/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Preview your sample ballot.</a></li>



<li><strong>Vote: </strong>Cast your ballot during early voting (October 13 – October 30) or on Election Day (November 3)<strong>.</strong></li>
</ul>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container"><div class="advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-">FAQ</div><div class="advgb-tab-_62f934-d2 advgb-tab-body" aria-labelledby="advgb-tabs-tab2">
<div class="wp-block-advgb-accordions advgb-accordions-88f38acd-1fb1-4fb0-95c6-46c556767702 advgb-accordion-wrapper">
<div class="wp-block-advgb-accordion-item advgb-accordion-item" style="margin-bottom:15px"><div class="advgb-accordion-header" style="background-color:#000;color:#eee;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:2px"><span class="advgb-accordion-header-icon"><svg fill="#fff" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" d="M0,0h24v24H0V0z"></path><path d="M12,5.83L15.17,9l1.41-1.41L12,3L7.41,7.59L8.83,9L12,5.83z M12,18.17L8.83,15l-1.41,1.41L12,21l4.59-4.59L15.17,15 L12,18.17z"></path></svg></span><h4 class="advgb-accordion-header-title" style="color:inherit"><strong>Q: How do I know if I am eligible to vote in this referendum?</strong></h4></div><div class="advgb-accordion-body" style="border-style:solid !important;border-width:1px !important;border-color:undefined !important;border-top:none !important;border-radius:2px !important">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A: Only registered voters who physically reside within the proposed SB 622 annexation boundary lines are eligible to vote on this ballot measure. <a href="https://mvp.sos.ga.gov/s/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Check your ballot to see if you are eligible.</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you believe your address is within the annexation boundaries but SB 622 does not appear on your ballot, please contact the <a href="mailto:annexation@tuckerga.gov">City of Tucker</a> or the <a href="mailto:voterreg@dekalbcountyga.gov">DeKalb County Board of Registration and Elections</a> office immediately.</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-accordion-item advgb-accordion-item" style="margin-bottom:15px"><div class="advgb-accordion-header" style="background-color:#000;color:#eee;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:2px"><span class="advgb-accordion-header-icon"><svg fill="#fff" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" d="M0,0h24v24H0V0z"></path><path d="M12,5.83L15.17,9l1.41-1.41L12,3L7.41,7.59L8.83,9L12,5.83z M12,18.17L8.83,15l-1.41,1.41L12,21l4.59-4.59L15.17,15 L12,18.17z"></path></svg></span><h4 class="advgb-accordion-header-title" style="color:inherit"><strong><strong><strong>Q: Why does my mail already say &#8220;Tucker&#8221; if I am in unincorporated DeKalb County?</strong></strong></strong></h4></div><div class="advgb-accordion-body" style="border-style:solid !important;border-width:1px !important;border-color:undefined !important;border-top:none !important;border-radius:2px !important">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A: The U.S. Postal Service assigns mailing names based on regional mail distribution hubs rather than official municipal boundaries. The postal designation “Tucker” does not by itself mean that a property is located within the incorporated City of Tucker.</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-accordion-item advgb-accordion-item" style="margin-bottom:15px"><div class="advgb-accordion-header" style="background-color:#000;color:#eee;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:2px"><span class="advgb-accordion-header-icon"><svg fill="#fff" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" d="M0,0h24v24H0V0z"></path><path d="M12,5.83L15.17,9l1.41-1.41L12,3L7.41,7.59L8.83,9L12,5.83z M12,18.17L8.83,15l-1.41,1.41L12,21l4.59-4.59L15.17,15 L12,18.17z"></path></svg></span><h4 class="advgb-accordion-header-title" style="color:inherit"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Q: Will annexation cause any issues or delays with my mail delivery?</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></h4></div><div class="advgb-accordion-body" style="border-style:solid !important;border-width:1px !important;border-color:undefined !important;border-top:none !important;border-radius:2px !important">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A: <strong>No, absolutely not.</strong> Mail delivery is operated independently by the federal U.S. Postal Service. Annexation changes municipal governance and services, but it has zero impact on postal carrier routes, sorting facilities or daily mail delivery.</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-accordion-item advgb-accordion-item" style="margin-bottom:15px"><div class="advgb-accordion-header" style="background-color:#000;color:#eee;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:2px"><span class="advgb-accordion-header-icon"><svg fill="#fff" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" d="M0,0h24v24H0V0z"></path><path d="M12,5.83L15.17,9l1.41-1.41L12,3L7.41,7.59L8.83,9L12,5.83z M12,18.17L8.83,15l-1.41,1.41L12,21l4.59-4.59L15.17,15 L12,18.17z"></path></svg></span><h4 class="advgb-accordion-header-title" style="color:inherit"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Q: Will my emergency services or 911 response change?</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></h4></div><div class="advgb-accordion-body" style="border-style:solid !important;border-width:1px !important;border-color:undefined !important;border-top:none !important;border-radius:2px !important">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A: <strong>No</strong>. Emergency services will remain completely uninterrupted. You will continue to call 911 just as you do today.</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-accordion-item advgb-accordion-item" style="margin-bottom:15px"><div class="advgb-accordion-header" style="background-color:#000;color:#eee;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:2px"><span class="advgb-accordion-header-icon"><svg fill="#fff" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" d="M0,0h24v24H0V0z"></path><path d="M12,5.83L15.17,9l1.41-1.41L12,3L7.41,7.59L8.83,9L12,5.83z M12,18.17L8.83,15l-1.41,1.41L12,21l4.59-4.59L15.17,15 L12,18.17z"></path></svg></span><h4 class="advgb-accordion-header-title" style="color:inherit"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Q: Will annexation change my child&#8217;s public school district?</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></h4></div><div class="advgb-accordion-body" style="border-style:solid !important;border-width:1px !important;border-color:undefined !important;border-top:none !important;border-radius:2px !important">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A: <strong>No. </strong>Public schools in the area would remain under the jurisdiction of the DeKalb County School District. City boundary lines do not change school attendance zones or school system operations.</p>
</div></div>
</div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container"><div class="advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-">Sample Ballot</div><div class="advgb-tab-_712852-5b advgb-tab-body" aria-labelledby="advgb-tabs-tab3">
<p class="has-background-background-color has-background has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">This is what your ballot should look like if you are a registered voter for your address in Atlas LaVista Hills, Avana City North or Providence of Northlake.</p>



<div class="wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-37befbfe wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained" style="padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)">
