<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
</div>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group has-background-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<p class="has-text-align-center has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-1 wp-block-paragraph" style="color:#ffffff;font-style:normal;font-weight:600"><em>CONTACT US FOR MORE INFO</em><br>If you have more questions, please contact the City of Tucker staff at annexation@tuckerga.gov</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide"/>



